  "body": "This adds them to the list of link types, defines that they are allowed\non `<a>`, `<area>`, and `<link>`, and adds them to the relevant supported\ntokens lists. The processing model defers to the Resource Hints\nspecification (as does prefetch, now).\n\nCloses #1109. @igrigorik, what do you think?\n",
